,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1337319,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/67/e7/0d92745d.jpg","nickname":"Billy火炎焱燚(不羁的风)","note":"","ucode":"63DED1EB2CF6AE","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":651165,"discussion_content":"是的","content_length":2,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1726359462,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":399150,"user_name":"Polo","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2680392,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"E0A71EABEEB89A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/28/e6/48/3c813be2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1743302862,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"思考题，这个我认为还是要衡量一下业务，结合公司实际情况，可以新开菜单方式部署rag，旧菜单仍然使用原功能，这样新旧都在运行，不影响已有业务，也能切入rag","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":399149,"user_name":"Polo","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2680392,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"E0A71EABEEB89A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/28/e6/48/3c813be2.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1743302768,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"源码终于运行起来了，github访问好几次才成功，将源码下载过来，环境也搭建好了，期待下一课\n\n对于这句话很有体会：\n使用Miniconda或Anaconda创建Python的虚拟环境是Python开发中的最佳实践之一，可以帮助管理项目依赖，确保项目的可移植性和可重复性\n\n之前一般都是全局环境操作，现在使用虚拟环境对于后续开发项目很重要，谢谢老师","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":405849,"user_name":"蓝色骑士","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3241161,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"841B49DC2BFC85","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/31/74/c9/2cd03a25.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1773113521,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"你好尝试运行示例，但是总提示 抱歉，数据库里面没有你需要的信息","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":403383,"user_name":"邢小林","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":4295349,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"41E06545F29B97","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/41/8a/b5/889c0b03.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1763349260,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"如果将结构化界面操作转化为自然语言，这会造成没有界面提示，用户也不知道输入什么语言来驱动，因此RAG在此场景中更适合作为副驾驶。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":403065,"user_name":"Fun.","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1019020,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"BE7510F01B0D3B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8c/8c/f5ec128c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1761176003,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"老师，https:&#47;&#47;mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn&#47; 清华镜像源下载页打不开，可以分享个替代的方案吗","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":401640,"user_name":"连瑞龙","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1898112,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"E0D3C3D4FCB7C9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/f6/80/1c5c8993.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1753097327,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"自然语言交互不仅提升效率，也降低了使用门槛。传统系统要求用户熟悉界面结构和字段含义，而借助 RAG 技术，用户只需用日常语言表达需求，如“查一下上个月销售额超过10万的客户”或“新增一个客户，姓名张三，电话123456”，系统即可自动识别并执行操作。这种能力对非技术人员尤其友好，提升了系统的可访问性。同时，结合 AG-UI 的理念，可以设计“混合交互模式”，即在自然语言输入的基础上，系统自动提供结构化表单、建议字段或操作路径，帮助用户确认和修正输入内容，实现“AI 辅助 + 用户确认”的渐进式交互。\n\n产品设计上，建议围绕自然语言查询（NLU）、自然语言录入（NLI）等核心场景展开，并融合 AG-UI 的交互理念。例如：\n\n- 查询结果应结构化展示并结合图表可视化，同时提供语音输入支持，进一步提升交互效率。\n- 数据录入时支持字段自动补全与语义纠错，并提供预览与确认机制确保准确性。\n- 修改和删除操作也应支持自然语言指令，同时引入操作确认机制防止误操作。\n- 在界面设计中加入 AI 推荐区域，如“可能你要查的是”、“建议填写项”等提示，增强人机协同体验。\n  \n从技术实现角度，RAG 架构由检索器（Retriever）和生成器（Generator）组成。检索器负责从数据库中召回相关数据，生成器负责将用户输入的自然语言转换为结构化操作指令。为提升语义理解准确率，建议构建领域词典与实体识别模型，并持续收集用户语句进行模型迭代。系统应提供统一的自然语言交互 API，支持多语言、多终端适配，包括 PC、移动端、语音助手等。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":398489,"user_name":"德慢慢","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2049906,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"F79F4C1A2C9EFA","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epa9fhIhtLUNkCqR9dxZTUolBLs40YiawZ4TUtvTG90HR0OyXzwU7icjyDiaF4FZOicyzRV1bGAylhs2A/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741442605,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100817901,"comment_content":"System check identified no issues (0 silenced).\nMarch 08, 2025 - 21:59:50\nDjango version 4.2.13, using settings &#39;mysite.settings&#39;\nStarting development server at http:&#47;&#47;127.0.0.1:8000&#47;\nQuit the server with CTRL-BREAK.\n","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":3212537,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/31/04/f9/3dbcd860.jpg","nickname":"加德满都的风铃","note":"","ucode":"C54A2B1DAE3E86","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":659403,"discussion_content":"这步是正常的啊。样式等你打开端口8000的服务器不就出来了","content_length":29,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1744014767,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398488,"user_name":"德慢慢","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2049906,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"F79F4C1A2C9EFA","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/v